      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coalton%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sits near the Appalachian foothills, a region long known for its coal mining heritage.",
